# LPA frontend

- Standalone components; `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` is the default.
- Production is zoneless. Use `signal()`, `computed()`, `effect()`. Do not add `zone.js` usage or Angular Material Dialog / CDK overlay. Dialogs use native `<dialog>` (`showModal()` / `close()`).
- All backend calls go through `RpcService.call`. Do not add new `HttpClient` REST wrappers for app RPCs.
- Services often expose both a `BehaviorSubject` and `toSignal()` (see `ProjectInfoService`).
- Project routes assume `contextResolver` has run (`GetGlobalContext` + `getProjectInfo`).
- For inputs typed `T | null | undefined`, templates should use `== null` (not `=== null`); the router may pass `undefined`.
- Watch service `providedIn` vs component-level providers (e.g. `EnabledViewsKeypointsService` on the viewer page).
